{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIyL1RoZSUyMEphbmVzJTIwJTI4MjAyMiUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"The Janes","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/hKWJ0hw1tWOONaQliyrp2wC6Rcm.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nQAfnJSH9kDxLi1pD9YxjeeG2rr.jpg","description":"Defying the state legislature that outlawed abortion, the Catholic Church that condemned it, and the Chicago Mob that was profiting from it, the members of “Jane” risked their personal and professional lives to support women with unwanted pregnancies. In the pre-Roe v. Wade era — a time when abortion was a crime in most states and even circulating information about abortion was a felony in Illinois — the Janes provided low-cost and free abortions to an estimated 11,000 women.","releaseInfo":"2022","genres":["Documentary","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.6","runtime":"101 min","cast":["Heather Booth","Judith Arcana","Marie Leaner","Diane Stevens","Eleanor Oliver","Martin Luther King Jr.","Walter Cronkite","Hugh Hefner"],"director":["Emma Pildes","Tia Lessin"],"released":"2022-05-03T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"They didn't have a choice.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Heather Booth","character":"Self"},{"name":"Judith Arcana","character":"Self"},{"name":"Marie Leaner","character":"Self"},{"name":"Diane Stevens","character":"Self"},{"name":"Eleanor Oliver","character":"Self"},{"name":"Martin Luther King Jr.","character":"Self (archive footage)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bclVGQbWbPRQRC94e855oP4Inw0.jpg"},{"name":"Walter Cronkite","character":"Self (archive footage)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hCIBybvwP7aMqwJFxcmVEyNrRyB.jpg"},{"name":"Hugh Hefner","character":"Self (archive footage)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7Qwu5fFUR6X9tJuKJdt2Vt6OBp6.jpg"}]},"trailers":[{"source":"pRbquE2BAkQ","type":"Trailer"}],"trailerStreams":[{"title":"Trailer","ytId":"pRbquE2BAkQ"}]}}